title Sets: the three demo songs saved, made into a set on screen, and played through from the Show view, each open and change timed
covers set-changes, open-times
needs demo-songs
# Live shows A4: the opens' own lines (project: ... opened in ...) and each
# change's (show: ... is in ..., N s after Go) say what an open and a change
# cost the MPC; devtest_report.py puts them in one table. The demo songs are
# put in the run's own library (RAM only on the MPC). Saved once each, so
# their kits' sounds are files the set's opens read.
wait 2
mark songs-saved
button BROWSE
# Sets then Projects: the list starts again with its first row picked, so
# the first tap on another song picks it and the second opens it.
tap browser place Sets
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Night Market
tap browser row Night Market
wait 1
expect project: Night Market opened in
tap header tab Arrange
button SHIFT + BROWSE
wait 1
expect project: saved Night Market
button BROWSE
tap browser place Sets
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Tidal Suite
tap browser row Tidal Suite
wait 1
expect project: Tidal Suite opened in
tap header tab Arrange
button SHIFT + BROWSE
wait 1
expect project: saved Tidal Suite
button BROWSE
tap browser place Sets
tap browser place Projects
# Glass Garden is the first row, picked already: one tap opens it.
tap browser row Glass Garden
wait 1
expect project: Glass Garden opened in
tap header tab Arrange
button SHIFT + BROWSE
wait 1
expect project: saved Glass Garden
mark set-made
tap header tab Arrange
button BROWSE
tap browser place Sets
tap browser sets-button New set
tap browser key Char('s')
tap browser key Char('h')
tap browser key Char('o')
tap browser key Char('w')
tap browser key Done
wait 0.5
tap browser sets-button Add songs
wait 0.5
tap browser sets-add Add Night Market
tap browser sets-add Add Glass Garden
tap browser sets-add Add Tidal Suite
tap browser sets-button Done
wait 0.5
# Each starts playing; Night Market ends with a fade (4 s), Glass Garden
# lets its tails finish (10 s at most), Tidal Suite is cut.
tap browser sets-row Night Market
tap browser sets-value Starts ›
tap browser sets-value Ends ›
tap browser sets-row Glass Garden
tap browser sets-value Starts ›
tap browser sets-row Tidal Suite
tap browser sets-value Starts ›
tap browser sets-value Ends ›
tap browser sets-value Ends ›
tap browser sets-back ‹ Show
wait 0.5
mark set-play
tap browser sets-button Play set
wait 3
expect project: Night Market opened in
expect show: Night Market is in (Playing)
wait 8
mark change-fade
tap show song 2 Glass Garden
tap show go Go
wait 8
expect show: the song ends (Fade(4))
expect project: Glass Garden opened in
expect show: Glass Garden is in (Playing)
mark change-finish
tap show song 3 Tidal Suite
tap show go Go
wait 14
expect show: the song ends (Finish)
expect project: Tidal Suite opened in
expect show: Tidal Suite is in (Playing)
mark change-cut
tap show song 1 Night Market
tap show go Go
wait 6
expect show: the song ends (Cut)
expect project: Night Market opened in
expect show: Night Market is in (Playing)
mark set-end
button STOP
button STOP
wait 1
